# Normalize line endings on checkout, whatever the platform.
#
# This matters more than usual here: two e2e cases edit a copy of the fixture's
# `zotero-plugin.config.ts` as *text* (adding a hook, removing a block). A CRLF
# checkout would make their literal matches silently miss, and the cases would
# then assert against the old configuration and still pass — a green test that
# tests nothing. Forcing LF removes that failure mode instead of guarding
# against it in every case.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Assets that must keep their bytes.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.xpi binary
*.zip binary
